text_mt:
Increase, O you who increase the entire threefold world, worshipped by the gods! / O Lord of deities, wipe away the tears of Indra!

You are the creator, the ordainer, and the destroyer; you are Maheśvara;
O great refuge, O great yogin, sleeping in yoga, praise be to you.
